# Helm / CRD rules

When editing `charts/` or `deploy/crd`:

- Observe is the default. `autopilotApply` (or equivalent) stays **false** unless documenting an explicit policy-gated path.
- Namespace Role stays read/propose; do not grant cluster-admin “for convenience.”
- Keep values, NOTES.txt, and `docs/agent*.md` aligned when flags/defaults change.
- Secrets: chart references Secret keys only — never commit real tokens or example `sk-` values that look live.
- CRD changes: update both `deploy/crd` and chart `crds/` (or document the single source of truth).
- Coordinator chart stays non-mutating (merge/handoff only).
- Prefer `helm template` / dry-run mentally against Role rules after RBAC edits.
